{"id": "1678757", "name": "עקבה של מכפלות ושל צירוף לינארי – trace(AB)=trace(BA) ולינאריות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "mattrace", "params": ["M"], "body": "M[1,1]+M[2,2]"}, {"name": "texp", "params": ["v"], "body": "if numberp(v) and v<0 then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(v),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(v)"}, {"name": "texmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(texp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "texsumf", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",texp(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "d11", "params": ["P", "Q"], "body": "sumf([mul(P[1,1],Q[1,1]),mul(P[1,2],Q[2,1])])"}, {"name": "d22", "params": ["P", "Q"], "body": "sumf([mul(P[2,1],Q[1,2]),mul(P[2,2],Q[2,2])])"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונות המטריצות</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}},\\qquad B={{CT:1}}\\]</p></div><p>חשבו את הבאים:</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">תזכורת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(M)\\)</span> הוא סכום איברי האלכסון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(M\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\text{trace}(AB)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\text{trace}(BA)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\text{trace}(xA+yB)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em\">בסעיף ג׳ <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y\\)</span> הם פרמטרים: התשובה היא ביטוי במשתנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\" style=\"unicode-bidi:isolate\">3*x-2*y</code>.</p></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כדי לחשב עקבה של מכפלה מספיק לחשב את שני איברי האלכסון שלה. אחר כך משתמשים בשתי תכונות של העקבה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(AB)=\\text{trace}(BA)\\)</span>, והעקבה לינארית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — העקבה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(AB\\)</span> (סעיף א׳)</b><br>איבר האלכסון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((i,i)\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(AB\\)</span> הוא שורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> כפול עמודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (AB)_{11}={{CT:2}}={{CT:3}},\\qquad (AB)_{22}={{CT:4}}={{CT:5}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\text{trace}(AB)={{CT:3}}+{{CT:6}}={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — העקבה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(BA\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>באותו אופן, שורה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> כפול עמודה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (BA)_{11}={{CT:8}}={{CT:9}},\\qquad (BA)_{22}={{CT:10}}={{CT:11}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\text{trace}(BA)={{CT:9}}+{{CT:12}}={{CT:13}} \\]</p>יצא אותו מספר, אף ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(AB\\neq BA\\)</span>. זה לא מקרי: לכל שתי מטריצות ריבועיות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(AB)=\\text{trace}(BA)\\)</span>, ולכן תמיד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(AB-BA)=0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(xA+yB)\\)</span> (סעיף ג׳)</b><br>העקבה לינארית: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(xA+yB)=x\\,\\text{trace}(A)+y\\,\\text{trace}(B)\\)</span>. כאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\text{trace}(A)={{CT:14}}={{CT:15}},\\qquad \\text{trace}(B)={{CT:16}}={{CT:17}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\text{trace}(xA+yB)={{CT:18}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A,B,trace", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A,B,trace", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A,B,trace", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tAB", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "AB[1,1]+AB[1,2]+AB[2,1]+AB[2,2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> חיברת את כל איברי המכפלה; העקבה היא רק סכום איברי האלכסון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> מספיק לחשב את שני איברי האלכסון של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(AB\\)</span> ולחבר אותם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "mattrace(BA)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> שימו לב: לכל שתי מטריצות ריבועיות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(BA)=\\text{trace}(AB)\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tlin", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> העקבה לינארית: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\text{trace}(xA+yB)=x\\,\\text{trace}(A)+y\\,\\text{trace}(B)\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "AB", "B", "BA", "ok", "tA", "tAB", "tB", "tlin", "trA", "trB"], "nvariants": 50}